:46Z","value":18,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5368860","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1847286114036719","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #3: Spectator Mode Has Arrived!","summary":"Demo Update #3: Spectator Mode Is Here! 💀With Steam Next Fest on the way, we want to thank everyone who’s jumped into the demo. The positive response, feedback, and support have been amazing!We’re only five days in, and our third update is already live.You asked, we listened: Spectator ModeYour time as a skull waiting to be revived just got a lot less boring. You can now see through the eyes of your fellow players and follow the action while they work on bringing you back. Or watch them make que","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:49:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036719","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:03:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1846651706691023","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out now!","summary":"Time to fire up the grill: the Grilluminati demo is now available on Steam!Play with 2–4 players in co-op. Looking for fellow cultists? Head to our Discord and find a group.The demo features four rituals… if you can make it that far. There are still a few rough edges, but we’re proud to share this first public taste of Grilluminati.A huge thank you to our playtesters and Discord community! Your feedback, bug reports, and encouragement helped make this possible.Enjoying the game? Please wishlist ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:16:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1844115010494441","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"The Final God: The Gourd-On Ramseye","summary":"We've saved the pickiest for last. For our third and final god, only the very best will do.Meet The Gourd-On Ramseye.The Cult Files #003: The Gourd-On RamseyeDemanding, impatient, and completely unpredictable.Preferred offerings: 🍽️Only prime ingredients are worthy of the Ramseye.Weird body parts. Exceptional victims. The finest ingredients your cult can get its blood-soaked hands on.Favorite victims: ✨The exceptional.The Ramseye isn't impressed by your average customer. If you're going to sacri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T11:01:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494441","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1841579228662869","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtests Begin Soon","summary":"The gods are getting hungry.In the next couple of weeks, we’ll start inviting the first players into closed Grilluminati playtests.Want to join the first playtests?Join our Discord and assign yourself the Sacrifices role. That’s where we’ll be picking and contacting players for the upcoming tests.👉 Join the Discord: https://discord.com/invite/dMrCNGw4jfSpaces for each test will be limited, and not everyone will be sacrificed at once.Your time will come. 🔪","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T14:57:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662869","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1840944183779526","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"God Number Two: The Golden Freye","summary":"Buckets of blood won't cut it for every god.Some have more expensive tastes... like The Golden Freye.The Cult Files #002: The Golden FreyeGreedy, greasy, and always looking for its next big offering.Preferred offerings: 🍟The Golden Freye likes its sacrifices the same way it likes its food: rich and greasy.Fatty cuts. Crispy parts. Anything fried.And if your victim happens to have deep pockets? Even better.Favorite victims: 💰The wealthy. Rich and heavily overweight? Yum yum!Thieves may earn you s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T12:47:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1838407329256769","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Your First God: The All-Seeing Ribeye","summary":"Greetings, loyal disciples!Every cult needs a god to worship and in Grilluminati you have three options. Allow us to introduce you to the first one: the All-Seeing Ribeye.The Cult Files #001: The All-Seeing RibeyeThe biggest, bloodiest, and most \"reasonable\" of the three Grilluminati gods. Preferred offerings: 🥩Meat. The Ribeye doesn't care about presentation or technique, it just wants volume! A single finger? Barely a snack.Buckets of blood? Now we're talking. Favorite victims: 🚬Smokers. Nothi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T14:06:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256769","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1835236783570322","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"25,000 Future Cultists","summary":"The congregation continues to grow.Since announcing Grilluminati less than a month ago, more than 25,000 people have added the game to their wishlist. It's been incredible to see the response so far, and we're hard at work turning Grilluminati into the chaotic co-op cult experience we envisioned.If you'd like to follow development more closely, join the congregation on Discord:👉 Join Our DiscordThank you for helping us reach this milestone.The gods are watching.— The Steakholders","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T13:39:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783570322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4703930-1834602721184114","game_id":"steam-4703930","kind":"announcement","title":"10,000 Souls Acquired","summary":"The rituals are working.We've just passed 10,000 wishlists for Grilluminati, and we wanted to say thank you to everyone who has followed, shared, commented, and spread the word about our totally legitimate steakhouse.Seeing so many people excited about our chaotic co-op cult game has been incredible, and we're grateful for every single wishlist.We're hard at work preparing more reveals, more gameplay, and more opportunities for you to join the cult. If you'd like to follow development more close","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T07:48:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721184114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4703930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4703930":"2026-10-26T13:38:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"470393